From: Niklas Klein <niklas@jklein.de>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:31:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ragfit: allow OIDC provider setup without token (0001
 sso-unlock)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Only OpenID Connect; SAML and other gated features unchanged.
See CHANGES-RAGFIT.md. GPLv3 §10.
---
 CHANGES-RAGFIT.md                             | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb   |  6 ++++--
 .../openid_connect/providers_controller.rb    |  7 ++-----
 .../openid_connect/providers/index.html.erb   |  3 +--
 .../lib/open_project/openid_connect/engine.rb |  4 ++--
 5 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 CHANGES-RAGFIT.md

diff --git a/CHANGES-RAGFIT.md b/CHANGES-RAGFIT.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..24c385fc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGES-RAGFIT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# RagFit changes to OpenProject (ErynoaGroup/openproject → RagFit | Plan)
+
+This repository is a modified version of OpenProject (GPL-3.0-only, © OpenProject GmbH).
+Per GPLv3 §5(a), all modifications are listed here with date. Upstream notices are kept unchanged.
+
+## 2026-10-10 — 0001 sso-unlock (branch `erynoa/sso-unlock`)
+
+**What:** OpenID Connect provider setup and OIDC login work without a token.
+Only the OIDC module is affected; SAML and all other token-gated features are unchanged.
+
+- `modules/auth_plugins/lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb`: `filtered_strategy?` also lets `:openid_connect` strategies through.
+- `modules/openid_connect/app/controllers/openid_connect/providers_controller.rb`: `check_ee` before_action removed.
+- `modules/openid_connect/app/views/openid_connect/providers/index.html.erb`: add button no longer disabled, upsell banner removed.
+- `modules/openid_connect/lib/open_project/openid_connect/engine.rb`: admin menu entry no longer marked as token feature.
+
+No tokens are created or simulated; `EnterpriseToken` itself is untouched.
+
+**Why:** RagFit | Plan logs in through RagFit | Source (OIDC). ErynoaGroup holds no commercial
+OpenProject contract or license (confirmed by Niklas Klein, 2026-10-10, recorded in ADR-003).
+GPLv3 §10 grants every recipient the right to modify and run the program; the code is GPLv3
+and no further restrictions may be imposed (§7, §10). Patch file: `ragfit/patches/0001-sso-unlock.patch`.
diff --git a/modules/auth_plugins/lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb b/modules/auth_plugins/lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb
index 1ccaef68..cde467d4 100644
--- a/modules/auth_plugins/lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb
+++ b/modules/auth_plugins/lib/open_project/plugins/auth_plugin.rb
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+# RagFit patch (erynoa/sso-unlock, 2026-10-10): OIDC provider setup available without token. GPLv3 §10 modification, see CHANGES-RAGFIT.md
 #-- copyright
 # OpenProject is an open source project management software.
 # Copyright (C) the OpenProject GmbH
@@ -89,9 +90,10 @@ module OpenProject::Plugins
       end
     end
 
-    def self.filtered_strategy?(_strategy_key, provider)
+    def self.filtered_strategy?(strategy_key, provider)
       name = provider[:name]&.to_s
-      EnterpriseToken.allows_to?(:sso_auth_providers) || name == "developer"
+      EnterpriseToken.allows_to?(:sso_auth_providers) || name == "developer" ||
+        strategy_key == :openid_connect # RagFit: OIDC only, SAML etc. stay gated
     end
 
     def self.strategy_key(strategy)
